# The release tag and hashes flake.nix fetches the dependency closures by. A moved tag or a
# re-uploaded file keeps its URL, so the hash, not the name, identifies an asset.
#
# To publish a new set:
#   1. nix develop .#built-cross, and test against the closures it builds from this commit
#   2. tools/deps/pack.sh <triple> in that shell, for each triple and for host-tools
#   3. bump the tag, paste the lines below
#   4. gh release create <tag> build/scratch/deps-assets/lxdyn-deps-*.tar.zst
#
# Bump the tag whenever the recipes, the source pins, the zig version or the glibc floor
# change. Never re-upload under an existing tag: anyone who already fetched it keeps a
# closure these hashes no longer describe.
#
# tag: closures-v2
